1
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,520
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:47,040
[Episode 16]

3
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:47,440
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:58,920
Don't look so sad.

6
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,460
Give me a smile.

7
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,160
Look.

8
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,490
I'm perfectly fine.

9
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,520
I'm sorry.

10
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:12,520
Today,

11
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,400
I caused you trouble again.

12
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,930
I don't mind trouble at all,

13
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,420
especially when it's you.

14
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:21,930
Have you been

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,330
feeling better lately?

16
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,680
Did you see him?

17
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:30,360
He's there again.

18
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:35,120
Sometimes,

19
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,860
he stands there looking at me.

20
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,200
Sometimes he wants to rush over.

21
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,580
Sometimes he wants to jump off

22
00:01:45,039 --> 00:01:46,200
like my dad did.

23
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:48,039
Sometimes...

24
00:01:53,830 --> 00:01:55,289
Is it because of her today?

25
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,410
I want to check on my mom.

26
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,320
Okay.

27
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,140
Let's go together.

28
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,160
Mom.

29
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,040
Tinglan, you're here.

30
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:20,560
It's been a long time.

31
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:22,180
Zhuo, you're here too.

32
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,400
Oh, your hand got hurt?

33
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,520
Mom.

34
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:28,000
I fell accidentally.

35
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,160
Auntie, how are you feeling these days?

36
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,120
Not bad.

37
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:34,760
Oh, Tinglan,

38
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,120
are you too busy with work?

39
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,480
You've lost weight.

40
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,120
Auntie,

41
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:40,120
I failed to look after her.

42
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:43,240
Mom,

43
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,360
has she been here lately?

44
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,680
No.

45
00:02:47,310 --> 00:02:48,200
Sounds good.

46
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:50,460
Does she make things hard for you at work?

47
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,440
So what if she does?

48
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,640
I couldn't care less.

49
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:54,720
Let's focus

50
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:56,720
on making a good life for ourselves.

51
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,770
That's more like it.

52
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:01,040
I'll focus on getting better too.

53
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,520
I'm waiting for you to take me home.

54
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:07,040
Oh,

55
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,960
I heated up some food in the microwave.

56
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,120
Go get it for me.

57
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:17,440
Here.

58
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,100
Have a seat.

59
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,400
If I remember correctly,

60
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,560
you are a client
of Tinglan's company, right?

61
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,360
Yes, Auntie.

62
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,120
Now I get it.

63
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:31,720
Well…

64
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,000
what do you mean?

65
00:03:34,079 --> 00:03:35,680
Jian's been used

66
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,840
to fighting for things since childhood.

67
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,840
Anything Tinglan likes

68
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,160
or anyone she loves,

69
00:03:41,430 --> 00:03:42,880
she must grab tightly

70
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,400
in her own hands.

71
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,240
Now,

72
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,240
she's out of tricks

73
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,560
to change your mind.

74
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,800
So she has no choice

75
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,480
but to use me instead.

76
00:03:58,650 --> 00:03:59,800
Okay, I got it.

77
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,880
Thanks for your help lately.

78
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:18,850
[No piling]

79
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:15,840
Tinglan,

80
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,279
cut the "thanks" every time.

81
00:04:18,810 --> 00:04:20,540
You know what I expect from you?

82
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,480
I know.

83
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,000
But between us,

84
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,480
there are still unresolved issues.

85
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,440
It's been a mess in my place,

86
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:32,800
so I won't invite you in.

87
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,280
It's okay.

88
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,120
You kept hearing strange noises

89
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,180
from the doorbell?

90
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,640
I'll stand by at the door.

91
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,840
Where is your furniture?

92
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,860
There was too much stuff here.

93
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:20,720
All those blind spots

94
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,560
have scared me.

95
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,040
Has it gotten this serious?

96
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:49,880
It's fine.

97
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,120
I'll get some good rest.

98
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,240
You may go.

99
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,560
Tinglan,

100
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:57,080
how can I feel relieved?

101
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,240
I'm begging you,

102
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,000
can I stay here for the night?

103
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,770
So when those noises appear again,

104
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,440
I can step in immediately.

105
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,320
Suit yourself.

106
00:06:44,730 --> 00:06:45,680
Stop.

107
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:50,320
Sorry.

108
00:07:00,390 --> 00:07:01,560
Still can't sleep?

109
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,760
Yeah.

110
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:06,000
But I feel a bit safer

111
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,620
than being home alone.

112
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:09,920
I'm sorry.

113
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:13,780
If I had known you were suffering so much,

114
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,780
I would’ve come back earlier.

115
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,720
I went abroad

116
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:19,800
to...

117
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:25,160
arrange the work
for the technical department.

118
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:26,160
It's okay.

119
00:07:27,470 --> 00:07:29,800
You don't have to
avoid her name like that.

120
00:07:30,570 --> 00:07:32,880
She means nothing to me now.

121
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,480
Yeah.

122
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:38,159
I went abroad

123
00:07:38,159 --> 00:07:39,290
to arrange her work.

124
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
She'll spend most of her time abroad

125
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,520
in the future.

126
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,159
Thank you.

127
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:53,960
However,

128
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,610
let's focus on work for now.

129
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,440
Right now,

130
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,360
I can't cut off all ties with her.

131
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,320
But I promise

132
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,240
that I will put an end

133
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,100
to all personal contact with her.

134
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,440
Jian's been used

135
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,760
to fighting for things since childhood.

136
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,120
We were neighbors.

137
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,680
It was just kids playing around.

138
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,840
Something happened to my family back then.

139
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,400
Sometimes I wanted
to jump off the building

140
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:58,640
like my dad did.

141
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,240
Yu'an.

142
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,160
Yu'an.

143
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:20,860
Without Jane here,

144
00:09:21,220 --> 00:09:21,760
we can't access the data.

145
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,560
I have the key.

146
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:25,640
Yu'an,

147
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,570
that's a client's privacy.

148
00:09:28,670 --> 00:09:30,930
We can't access it without reporting it.

149
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:33,000
Do you know how much damage

150
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,280
it will cause to our company?

151
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,640
Yu'an,

152
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:38,880
when we founded this company,

153
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,960
our core competitive edge was

154
00:09:41,210 --> 00:09:42,960
ensuring user data security.

155
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:44,720
Once you access

156
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,000
private user data,

157
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,450
our company's image

158
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:49,240
will be ruined.

159
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,120
Where is Wen Jian?

160
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,040
Wen Jian?

161
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:56,240
She went back to headquarters yesterday.

162
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,040
What's wrong?

163
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,640
Tell her

164
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:00,080
to return immediately.

165
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:01,840
Yu'an,

166
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,480
what happened?

167
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,320
Sorry.

168
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,240
I don't want anyone else
to know about this.

169
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,850
Weren't you taking us home?

170
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:23,240
Why are we at your place?

171
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,210
You really want your mom

172
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:28,120
to see an empty house like yours?

173
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:33,480
Don't worry.

174
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,200
I won't say anything.

175
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:38,960
Auntie,

176
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,320
we've arrived.

177
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:45,220
Let me help you out.

178
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,000
Tinglan,

179
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,320
open the door.

180
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:03,820
You rented this place.

181
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,370
Who are you waiting for?

182
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:19,680
Take care.

183
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:29,160
Tinglan, when did you rent this new place?

184
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,490
You didn't even tell me.

185
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,840
It's close to the company

186
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,780
and more convenient for commuting.

187
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:35,720
Go on chatting.

188
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:37,330
I'll go buy some groceries.

189
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:41,480
Mom,

190
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,440
have a seat.

191
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:52,690
I've been in the hospital forever.

192
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,040
I've forgotten

193
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,540
what home looks like.

194
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,340
I talked to the doctor.

195
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,120
He said you're doing much better.

196
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:01,120
Coming home for a few days every week

197
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,880
is better for your recovery.

198
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:05,800
Our old place

199
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,280
is getting new furniture,

200
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:09,000
so we brought you here.

201
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:13,380
Zhuo helped you with this, right?

202
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:17,460
How long have you been dating?

203
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:18,800
Mom,

204
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,680
we're not dating.

205
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,850
We're just friends.

206
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,440
I'm clear-headed now.

207
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:26,480
You'd better

208
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:28,200
be honest with me.

209
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:30,920
On New Year's Eve,

210
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,760
he even kept us company in the hospital.

211
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:34,080
His hand injury I saw

212
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,620
was because of you, right?

213
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:37,840
And today,

214
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,480
all the way here,

215
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,880
he helped out without complaining.

216
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,410
What kind of ordinary friend

217
00:12:43,410 --> 00:12:45,200
would do so much for you?

218
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:48,200
Tinglan, tell me the truth.

219
00:12:48,650 --> 00:12:50,400
You like Zhuo too, don't you?
